    "body": "I came from https://github.com/akinomyoga/ble.sh/issues/239#issuecomment-1428565807. Here are my comments as the developer of ble.sh.\r\n\r\nAlso, ble.sh has PREEXEC & POSTEXEC hooks. I haven't tested it but a suggested change is\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n-if [[ \"${__bp_imported:-}\" == \"defined\" || $preexec_functions || $precmd_functions ]]; then\r\n+if [[ ${BLE_VERSION-} && _ble_version -ge 400 ]]; then\r\n+  blehook PREEXEC!='starship_preexec \"$_\"'\r\n+  blehook POSTEXEC!='starship_precmd'\r\n+elif [[ \"${__bp_imported:-}\" == \"defined\" || $preexec_functions || $precmd_functions ]]; then\r\n```\r\n",
